        "sys_support_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Normal killer moves are activated by one Gu Master, as with Zheng tribe leader’s Thunder Bird. Fang Yuan had already seen this move obstruct the night wolf myriad beast king and inflict serious injuries. While it lasts, the wind wolf myriad beast king cannot advance. After it dissipates, that wolf king is free to kill Zheng tribe elders.",
